WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>Japanese OK</b>

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.480
What? She really said that?

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.700
Yeah. She said she hated 
how it felt like cheating.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.280
I guess that's just like Nene-nee.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.030
What do we do now?

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.440
I'm not going to try to come up
 with strategies anymore.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.580
She said she wants to fight fair and 
square when the next full moon comes.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.370
I see...

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.390
But can she win?

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:28.080
Ernesta and Tsuchimikado 
are both renowned mages.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:29.840
She'll be fine.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.290
Our family has produced feng shui 
masters for 4,000 years.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:44.770
I know you've teamed up to try to defeat me.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.360
So just be sure you come prepared.

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:52.650
<i>Mother...</i>

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:18.970
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:18.970
The Two Princeps

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.910
It's incredible...

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.970
<i>This must be the stage 
for this month's battle.</i>

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.180
<i>It's time.</i>

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.360
<i>All right, then, as we discussed.</i>

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:05.110
Yeah.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:15.020
The feng shui master Lin Fen Fen 
participated in past GRANBELM battles.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.510
It's said that she was considerably strong.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.170
Her ARMANOX specialized in ranged attacks,

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.180
and excelled in its ability 
to detect opponents, as well.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.490
So you think this battle will be the same?

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:30.520
This is her daughter. They may 
not be perfectly identical,

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:33.150
but her ARMANOX is likely to 
be similar to her mother's.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.400
Normally, when an ARMANOX launches an attack,

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:42.910
the magic response can be 
detected through the threads.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:49.370
But with JI GUAN LONG, I could 
barely even sense that at all.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.710
But you can sense it, right, Kuon-chan?

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:56.450
When magical power is 
unleashed, I can hear it.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.740
Position confirmed.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.850
<i>You figured it out?</i>

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:11.790
Yes.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.170
I'm best suited to provide

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:17.500
the appropriate backup after 
assessing the situation.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:20.820
Besides, if I act carelessly...

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.780
That Anna girl, right?

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:29.110
Yes. So, Mangetsu, I need you 
to go with SETSGETS BAIKA.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.750
If ACONITE GRIS is about to interfere,

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.650
I'll draw it away.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:35.640
<i>How's it look?</i>

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:36.470
Shh.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.130
Here they come.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.090
Right!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.610
That many?!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:51.220
All but one of them are dummies 
meant to make her harder to locate.

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.850
Only one is real.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.480
Mangetsu, are you all right?

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:03.990
Yeah, I'm—

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:07.730
Do I have to bust my way through these?

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.870
<i>Don't bother attacking. You'll only
 give away our location.</i>

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.090
<i>How's it going?</i>

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:21.840
I've got my barrier up to prevent 
them from detecting my magic.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.110
Of course, that's a given...

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.930
<i>We did expect that. Can you 
see with your own eyes?</i>

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.050
Is that possible?

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.480
<i>It should be.</i>

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.110
<i>The most important thing is 
the pilot's mental image.</i>

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.140
Yeah... Not bad!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:07.050
Can she detect us even after all this?

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.730
I'm not sure,

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:12.010
but she definitely knows where we are.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.330
It looks like a massive number,

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.040
but there's only one location 
they're being fired from.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.660
No...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.810
There are many similar sounds,

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:31.310
but only one is real.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.630
I found you.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.140
Embers!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:55.160
Suishou!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.730
<i>Aye!</i>

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.000
Make sure we remain 
undetected, no matter what.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.680
<i>Aye-aye!</i>

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:06.350
Milady sure is petty, though...

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.700
How very human of her.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.770
<i>What happened?</i>

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:23.540
My barrier took a direct hit!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.750
<i>Wasn't it a stray round?</i>

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.140
But...

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:29.210
<i>Are you going to run? We'll 
leave it up to your judgment.</i>

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:44.780
<i>I found her.</i>

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.300
Are you sure?

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.110
<i>Back me up.</i>

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.360
<i>WHITE LILY, over here.</i>

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:50.610
Here?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:55.030
Okay... but the attacks 
are still pretty intense!

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:07.510
They stopped...

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:11.220
<i>Could it be... instead of magic 
detection, she's simply using her eyes?</i>

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:20.690
Looks like they realized
 I'm aiming with my own eyes.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.120
<i>Any magic traces?</i>

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:27.680
They're far off, so I can only 
pick up on a little of it...

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:28.860
But...

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.780
She shouldn't be able to see me!

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.240
I see it!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.960
<i>She attacks with such precision!</i>

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:49.040
That's just how talented she is.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:52.970
<i>They're getting closer!</i>

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.380
I know!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.800
So, which one?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.550
Don't look. Feel the power with your hands.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:05.600
You'll know.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.840
Which one harbors the technique?

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:21.330
<i>More... I have to focus more.</i>

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:25.080
<i>Until I can see it... Until 
I can see it in my mind...</i>

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.000
I see it... I see it!

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.680
Envision... Envision!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:48.980
Hot!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.300
Envision!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:01.730
Mangetsu...

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.240
That way!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:04.570
I can see it!

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:05.910
It's over there!

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.070
No...

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.230
I can't...

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.020
She's gone... Kuon-chan?

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.330
<i>That's definitely the 
position Kuon pointed out.</i>

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.720
<i>Did she run away?</i>

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.560
Maybe, I guess...

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.560
But... She knew WHITE LILY was here, too...

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.930
Kuon? Kuon, where are you?

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.020
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.520
Kuon? What's going on?

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:22.740
Oh, that's not nearly enough.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.830
So it was true?

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.680
Of course!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:31.040
It's Shisui, isn't it? 
The one who was cursed.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.250
How did you know?

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.340
Pop quiz!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.340
How <i>did</i> I know that?

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:41.260
Answer me!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.760
I'm the one asking the questions.

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:51.230
That's...

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.690
Kuon! Kuon! It can't be...

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.030
I can't believe it took 
you this long to notice!

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:05.150
What a fool!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.560
Anna...

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:11.340
In this space, overflowing with magical power,

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:16.330
what do you think would happen if 
I were to deploy a magic circle?

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.630
Say goodbye!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.450
What? Shingetsu-chan?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.470
Shingetsu-chan...

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:30.730
What happened?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.390
<i>Another mage has deployed something.</i>

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.690
<i>But it's okay. It's having no effect on you.</i>

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:40.220
<i>Be patient. That's JI GUAN LONG's ability.</i>

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:44.040
<i>It's your ability to hide, as a hermit.</i>

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.850
I don't feel like that's a compliment...

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.810
<i>The next time she turns 
her back to you, fire.</i>

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.260
<i>At this range, your barrier 
would be destroyed.</i>

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.540
<i>Nene-nee!</i>

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.340
I don't like this.

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.330
Huh?

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.260
I don't like doing this.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.150
Shingetsu-chan? Kuon-chan?

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:09.460
What...

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:37.170
There!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.420
I've been spotted!

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:39.820
Nene-nee!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.420
You hesitated too long!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.260
Shut up! This is just fine!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.620
You know, for such a shut-in...

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:49.390
That's just like her, though.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.590
<i>Your ARMANOX is a reflection 
of your own soul.</i>

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:58.240
<i>The stronger Nene-nee's 
wish is, the stronger she is.</i>

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.010
<i>Show us your wish, Nene-nee!</i>

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:03.390
Okay.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.260
JI GUAN LONG!

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.160
What?!

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:41.530
Nene-chan...

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.650
<i>Mother...</i>

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.280
<i>Watch me.</i>

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.050
She's strong!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.410
This is what you deserve!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:24.240
You betrayed me, took everything from me,

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:28.070
and condemned me to torment, 
so this is your punishment!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.650
Ernesta!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.290
Wha—

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.740
In this space, overflowing 
with magical power...

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.800
Did you really think I, a mage, 
would have no plan?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.500
Ernesta!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.900
I'll say it over and over.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.630
You cannot defeat me.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.780
Who put that curse on my sister?

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:11.990
You want to know?

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.020
I'll be happy to tell you...

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.160
once this is all over!

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:26.400
<i>Nene!</i>

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.300
What?

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:28.750
<i>You should withdraw for now.</i>

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:29.740
No!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.690
<i>Can you win this?</i>

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.410
I can!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:17.020
When did...

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:27.010
What the heck is this?!

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:28.710
Ten.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.050
Nine.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.480
No way...

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:33.490
Eight.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.570
Seven.

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:37.770
Envision! Envision!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.770
Six.

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.380
Envision!

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:39.380
Five.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:41.800
Four.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.600
Three.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:46.910
Two.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:49.390
One.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.520
<i>Why... Mother?</i>

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:31.100
<i>Don't go! I don't want to say goodbye!</i>

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.830
<i>Liar! Liar! Liar!</i>

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:39.190
<i>I did just as you told me to do!</i>

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.850
No!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:44.490
No way...

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:58.110
No... No!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:01.330
No!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.280
No!

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:16.000
Mother!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:20.710
You told me to live without hating
 myself, and that's what I've done!

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:26.810
I've remembered what it means to be a mage
 because you told me never to forget!

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:28.170
Mommy!

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:30.390
Mommy!

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.850
What is a mage?

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:44.420
You have the wrong person.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.650
I'm sorry.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:53.160
This is... Nene-chan's...

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:55.370
Mommy...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:57.720
Mommy...

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:19.640
So this is...

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:23.650
GRANBELM...

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:27.030
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:57.030 --> 00:24:00.040
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:02.460
<i>With Nene out of the battle, the field
 of contenders narrows further.</i>

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.820
<i>As emotions of all types run high,</i>

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:08.050
<i>obsession eats away at all of the girls.</i>

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:12.300
<i>Is victory truly good fortune? 
Is loss truly misfortune?</i>

00:24:13.020 --> 00:24:16.220
<i>And, at last, a new player makes a move.</i>

00:24:17.530 --> 00:24:18.850
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:20.850
<b>Magic Stones</b>

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:20.420
<i>"Magic Stones."</i>

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:23.600
<i>Jealousy is much like the taste of blood.</i>

00:24:27.060 --> 00:24:30.070
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
